 "remarks": "WELCOME TO THE RANCH ON STUDIO, where warmth, space & style come together effortlessly. Cherished by the same family for 33 years, this move-in ready home has been thoughtfully updated with an eye toward function & aesthetics. Refreshed spaces, distinctive lighting & a polished mix of materials & finishes reflect the owner's design sensibility. From the moment you enter, the home feels open & inviting. The flexible layout flows between generous gathering spaces & quieter retreats. At its heart, the kitchen, dining area & family room create a connected living space for everyday living & entertaining. A wall of windows wraps the area with natural light, frames views of the trees & creates a seamless indoor-outdoor feel. The renovated kitchen features a large center island, stainless steel appliances, walk-in pantry & adjacent laundry/mudroom. Rich hardwood floors extend throughout. The spacious living room is anchored by a cozy wood-burning fireplace. A chic, fully renovated powder room adds another layer of style. Three large bedrooms are tucked into a separate wing, with French doors allowing the area to be closed off for privacy. A fourth room offers flexibility as a guest room, office, playroom or exercise room. Outside, the one-acre property includes a patio, firepit area & ample space to relax & gather. The expansive unfinished attic & basement, w generous ceiling height & multiple points of egress already in place, add nearly 2,000 sqft. of functional space.",
